            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-dark mb-4">How often should I have my dryer vent cleaned?</h3>
            <p class="text-base leading-relaxed text-text/80">
              The National Fire Protection Association recommends annual dryer vent cleaning for most households. If you have a larger family, do multiple loads per week, or have pets that shed heavily, you may need cleaning every 6-9 months. Regular cleaning prevents fires and keeps your dryer running efficiently.
            </p>
