            <p class="text-base leading-relaxed text-text/80">
              Key warning signs include: clothes taking longer than normal to dry, dryer getting very hot to the touch, burning smell when running, excessive lint around the dryer door, outside vent flap not opening when dryer runs, and higher energy bills. If you notice any of these, schedule cleaning immediately.
            </p>
