            <p class="text-base leading-relaxed text-text/80">
              We perform a complete system cleaning: initial safety inspection, disconnect dryer, clean entire vent line with professional rotary brushes, clean exterior vent hood, remove all lint and debris, reconnect dryer with proper fittings, conduct airflow test, and provide maintenance recommendations. We clean the entire system, not just what's easily accessible.
            </p>
